          "guid": "mt3h9e2sv8wdl2z1",
          "message": {
            "text": "A mask image is itself painted content for fragmentation activation. The previous background-or-border gate skipped getClientRects() for a mask-only wrapping inline, so the renderer could never reconstruct Blink's continuous PaintRectForImageStrip; including maskImage here keeps the capture boundary aligned with the fragment geometry consumed by src/render/mask.ts. The related browser row deliberately has no background or border, and passes Chromium-vs-SVG pixels.",
            "markdown": "A mask image is itself painted content for fragmentation activation. The previous background-or-border gate skipped getClientRects() for a mask-only wrapping inline, so the renderer could never reconstruct Blink's continuous PaintRectForImageStrip; including maskImage here keeps the capture boundary aligned with the fragment geometry consumed by src/render/mask.ts. The related browser row deliberately has no background or border, and passes Chromium-vs-SVG pixels."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/script/walker/fragmentation.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 65,
                  "endLine": 76,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "      var _bgC = captured.styles.backgroundColor;\n      var _hasBg = _bgC != null && _bgC !== '' && _bgC !== 'transparent' && _bgC !== 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)';\n      var _hasBgImage = captured.styles.backgroundImage != null\n        && captured.styles.backgroundImage !== '' && captured.styles.backgroundImage !== 'none';\n      var _hasMaskImage = captured.styles.maskImage != null\n        && captured.styles.maskImage !== '' && captured.styles.maskImage !== 'none';\n      var _btw = parseFloat(captured.styles.borderTopWidth || '0') || 0;\n      var _brw = parseFloat(captured.styles.borderRightWidth || '0') || 0;\n      var _bbw = parseFloat(captured.styles.borderBottomWidth || '0') || 0;\n      var _blw = parseFloat(captured.styles.borderLeftWidth || '0') || 0;\n      var _hasBorder = _btw > 0 || _brw > 0 || _bbw > 0 || _blw > 0;\n      var _hasPaint = _hasBg || _hasBgImage || _hasBorder || _hasMaskImage;"
                  }
